matam hai bahrobar mein bimar-e-karbala ka<br>
<br>
1. chalis saal tak jo rota raha pidar ko<br>
zehr-e-dagha diya hain uss nouhagar pisar ko<br>
mara gaya sitam se pota woh murtaza ka<br>
<br>
2. gardan mein tauq thi aur pairo mein bediya thi<br>
humraha karbala se be parda bibiya thi<br>
tha har khadam pe mehshar aur zulm inteha ka<br>
<br>
3. tha karbala se koofa koofey se sham jaana<br>
tha saath bibiyon ke zulm-o-sitam uthana<br>
aasa na tha safar yeh islam ki baqa ka<br>
<br>
4. khaidi bana tha jismein shabbir ka gharana<br>
mushkil tha saans lena aisa tha qaid khana<br>
bhooley se bhi nahi tha jis mein guzar hawa ka<br>
<br>
5. rulva rahi thi sab ko abid ki bekasi bhi<br>
rooh-e-hassan thi naala hyder bhi aur nabi bhi<br>
tukdey jigar tha gham se jannat se fatima ka<br>
<br>
6. sajjad ka hai nouha shabbir ka hai matam<br>
lehra raha hai khoo mein abbas ka yeh parcham<br>
sadiq mila sahara taeed-e-sayeda ka